'''The Lift''' is the first section of the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} players visit after completion of {{NPCSprite|Rhys}}' quest. It can be used by players to talk to the {{NPCSprite|Lift Operator}} and access other sections of the {{Zone|Deep Caverns}}. It can also be entered from the {{Zone|Ironman's Guild}}: however, it serves no purpose there.

